```python
# Turn 6 — only reaches the runner if the FSM has stayed IDLE through
# turns 1-5 (no goto enqueued). That means we never saw the goal;
# fail honestly so the log reflects it.
nodes = list_scene()["value"]
print("la7 final seen:", [(n["label"], n["world_xy"]) for n in nodes])
seen_labels = sorted({n["label"] for n in nodes})
fail("stove not found after 5 observation turns; saw: " + str(seen_labels))
```
EOF
